## Method and data freshness

- Award prices come from each airline's own search, queried with the real party size; offers are marked "searched pax = 1" only when they were found by the split search, and are assigned just one passenger unless that airline's prices are verified not to depend on party size.
- Seat counts: exact where the airline publishes them; "≥n" means at least n seats are proven to exist.
- Top options were re-checked live just before the report ("re-check" status). Award space can vanish at any time — book soon after confirming.
- Knowledge base (partners, transfer ratios, charts) last verified: {% for k, v in kb_verified.items() %}{{ k }} {{ v }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}. Confirm transfer partners and ratios before moving points; transfers cannot be undone.

